{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Store a whole "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on disk and load it again with the same entities, components and entity identifiers."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/savingandloadingscenes"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A nexus encodes as a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": every entity with its original identifier, the components conforming to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","isActive":true},{"text":", and the state of the entity identifier generator.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The snapshot works with any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" format, such as JSON, property lists or YAML.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Make-components-serializable","text":"Make components serializable"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Conform each component you want to persist to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", or annotate it with "},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Give each persisted type an explicit, stable name. The default name is the fully qualified Swift type name, which changes when you rename the type or its module:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["final class Position: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Position\"","    var x: Double","    var y: Double","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you rename a type later, list its former names, so existing scene files keep loading:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["final class Health: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Health\"","    static let componentTypeNameAliases = [\"HitPoints\"]","    var value: Int","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Components referencing other entities can store an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Both are restored correctly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Save-and-load-a-nexus-with-Codable","level":3,"text":"Save and load a nexus with Codable"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so it can be part of your own scene type:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct Scene: Codable {","    var name: String","    var nexus: Nexus","}","","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(Scene(name: \"Level 1\", nexus: nexus))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes] = [Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self] as [any SerializableComponent.Type]","decoder.userInfo[.nexusEntityResolver] = EntityReferenceResolver(mapping: [:]) \/\/ needed for `Entity` properties","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)"]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Encoding throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError\/notSerializable(typeName:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for components that are not serializable.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To leave runtime-only components out instead, set ","type":"text"},{"code":"encoder.userInfo[.nexusNonSerializableComponentHandling]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling\/skip","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoding needs all component types of the scene in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes]"},{"text":". Unknown names throw ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentRegistryError\/unknownTypeName(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decoded nexus has the same entity identifiers and creates new entities with the identifiers the original nexus would have used next.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Load-into-an-existing-nexus","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Load into an existing nexus"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To keep a configured nexus, for example one with a delegate, families or a custom generator, use the snapshot API directly:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var encoder = JSONEncoder()","let data = try nexus.encodeSnapshot(using: &encoder, handling: .throwError)","","let restored = Nexus()","try restored.register([Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self])","var decoder = JSONDecoder()","try restored.restoreSnapshot(from: data, using: &decoder)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/restoreSnapshot(from:using:)"},{"text":" keeps the entity identifiers. It requires a nexus without entities and emits the usual entity and component events.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/decodeSnapshot(from:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":" adds the snapshot as new entities to a populated nexus, for example for prefabs, and returns the mapping from saved to new identifiers."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both roll back all changes if decoding fails."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Use-other-formats","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Use other formats"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The snapshot API accepts any coder conforming to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelEncoder","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelDecoder","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyListEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" and their decoders conform out of the box."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For other formats, add the conformance in your project. For example, with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/jpsim\/Yams","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Yams","","struct YAMLSceneEncoder: TopLevelEncoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func encode<T: Encodable>(_ value: T) throws -> String {","        try YAMLEncoder().encode(value, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}","","struct YAMLSceneDecoder: TopLevelDecoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func decode<T: Decodable>(_ type: T.Type, from yaml: String) throws -> T {","        try YAMLDecoder().decode(type, from: yaml, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Nexus: Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" works with any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" coder directly."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For deterministic output, for example for scene files under version control, sort the keys, e.g. with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder.OutputFormatting.sortedKeys"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"What-a-snapshot-contains","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"What a snapshot contains"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entity, including entities without components, with its original identifier.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every serializable component. A component instance shared by several entities is stored once and shared again after loading."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entity identifier generator state, if the generator conforms to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" does."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not contained are components that are not serializable, families (they are derived from the components) and the nexus delegate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The format is versioned by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Newer versions of FirebladeECS keep loading older snapshots and reject snapshots written by a newer version."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Saving and Loading Scenes","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS":{"role":"article","title":"Getting started with Fireblade ECS","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Learn the API and key types Fireblade provides to compose your game or app logic.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/gettingstartedwithfirebladeecs"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/SerializableComponent":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/serializablecomponent","title":"SerializableComponent","role":"symbol","abstra